{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1412,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6408c09b1708e6bc6f83a57d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也想像丸善斯基小姐那样，\n像个成熟的大人那样打招呼呢……\n……嗨♪……算、算了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c885e8edaa6445c92ad7acd7fb4bee41dd26baaa345f488cfd89b155e41298a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e135f2f1bcbb181356b1bc32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和阿尔丹同学一起选了和点心很搭的\n日本茶呢。说起来，上次选的是\n红茶……下次要不选绿茶吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "abe45c08f76d0bbbbc0573538571c28ef6bca3c96dc0c57bcd85903861394598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a641401034c5ecb31d9cb759",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千代王千代王千代王！…唔……\n果然和进王同学的名字比起来，\n我的名字这样连着读不大顺口呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d44700ce12f869b6cc1321db2a9a276e83c91d030a059781ec5eb2c1a27039a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b626d575ee6c74c68093db0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做红豆馅的时候会不小心做太多……\n因为在家习惯了，不小心会把家人的份也一起做了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "639df0937a44b223074cfa5d2009a6824bdc56034074f9806983124ae10d486f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28bbfa1f904ea27c507571f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『整洁的房间是心灵的宝石箱』！\n别看我这样，我对整理东西还是很在行的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0093514e0709c32c150948d0f5ad83775ac5f1391093b63ce73ca92600f1823",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4ba687ba6b56b005922953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『舞台与赛场同处一片天空之下』！\n在舞台上也要全力以赴地表演呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14aa0cd31f3967092316cbce86bb085a4c44e31fa7ec9c9e1c8a699c4d6e6740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2dde30aad6cf5352a7b94d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次完成难度很高的舞蹈时，\n就会充分感觉到自己的成长……\n然后就有继续努力的干劲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcf86c467ac65bad746f54a608ef95cb92d12219e95c9db4c5fc379ad10676aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47a090860af4579e88ccafbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『比赛中也要让心灵时刻满开』！\n寄宿在这身衣服之中的愿望，\n我一定会让其开花结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6375f57216e1e243cc58ecf48bb05f99461454b2f1190912141a26297908f296",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b27b4a7d93c49da508cca55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基小姐对我说过：\n『小千代，这身决胜服和你很搭哦』……\n诶嘿嘿嘿……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f69f8e89a620e4f7cb97499edb00755fb06b7fe028c95f4385d48eec52a047c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdad766b0b3d78b37f18d639",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晨跑后深呼吸的话，\n清新的空气能让我一下子就打起精神来！\n我很喜欢这种感觉呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1857693b79aa28be2327e6595468a4cf11df33361ef1a3c276e38f9194e6ba7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b02be311a27b88ab5b956c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须要复习刚刚学习的内容…正所谓\n『早早复习学力就会节节高升』！\n啊，当然、预习也很重要呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffd6b2ef4addb4e2f1cce253d5272d3289be4cda9e455cc174be0b8b859a9ed1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b441758ae920237165c41bdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是要切磋吗？\n那就来比比谁能\n绽放得更绚丽吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c84f5fafc6a12838baf5b1181d057977b843ffb02bd3f30cf0500c67094990dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f47155f7c9d5ee99bcc52e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼嗯～～……啊哇哇哇！\n我刚刚不是在打哈欠哦！是那个……\n嗯……对了！是打哈欠的练习！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c031a980dd4be53c8c99037dc2cdd12b3fcec95c09a6ea4f6addda841a5262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b5fc23b1ea7dc4c12885647",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了这个季节的话就可以做樱饼了呢。\n因为我今年也打算做很多，所以可以的话……\n能请您帮帮我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fdc791afbd35c2d297033f4a60e19925f9e8699c567d58325c7b6e95ec2b758",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb48104e849089aab97f2a72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节的水羊羹很好吃呢……\n啊！不过，也想吃锦玉呢！\n唔嗯～实在不知道吃哪个好……",
      "source_fingerprint": "23fdac048fd7d70a712b3fc6f9e3c8f7abaa83631a9e9c3e96d4e7eb18a4bb7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d98a7c7a0a2c822e630ee958",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿尔丹同学送了我栗子蛋糕，\n所以我做了栗子蒸羊羹作为回礼哦！\n不知道合不合她口味呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "63daf86d2bdc249d5ebe54cf5fea9464c531f111bc2dbd48d614cf84820e897c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea5a30a7e723c642eccccb92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在常去的点心店里看见了柚子饼哦！\n不知不觉已经到这个季节了呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0dfc99e094e813ead3993837401b43ca9674eecbc6a636df46f82a530735e03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:571aaba1bed08be1ee8ec82b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "进王同学、樱花桂冠同学，\r\n再加上我！\r\n我们是「胜利俱乐部」，哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "52f455085e40d1342ba4014b12656effc94fd678a6d03988ed2a28d4d9aaecd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca8742944a8e478547123907",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一看到高雅的阿尔丹同学……\r\n我也会忍不住挺直腰板呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bb241a1d016142dd197d347d21115450a4295f3f3a5e5dda9eebf539bac6cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ccd0846af6d8382920d1525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要穿这件衣服去吃烤肉，\r\n感觉我会非常紧张……\r\n深怕一不小心被酱汁溅到……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "619b4ccf901ed03f7fac93ed36b57b52acac7f299c1c8d53ebbf3f05d8cbf7c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a55ad2c50b1a43931d747e53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道为什么，唯独和超级溪流前辈的时间\r\n总是合不上呢～\r\n明明我很想多和她相处的说～",
      "source_fingerprint": "af55c25ba1dbfb11a2b3198334cc6084d176d6ae47bf944c9046961d44efc098",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5691863f211c10edb851280",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花是樱花，目白是目白。\r\n「有多少情谊，情意就有多深」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b2d6a7765a8f6b661aef712e82a696ebe95c1c8eb8d4e1194dc934d092fd126",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673a7168a1b84ae378171718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所谓的晨礼服，\r\n是早上穿的意思吗……？\r\n那就代表礼服也可以在早上穿吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a163b2e2e13c6da882786476e03aa7290dfd9847abb32391479474a758b2dc03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5ccf9ad0ebdba2282a93104",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午试着和草上飞同学比比和歌吧。\r\n虽然我常常被大家说有种\r\n难以理解的深奥感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe124e1740a1a8fb2852ae8d2f22b9d1ff3c4e62d585cce588485783a8325ddc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b8dd385ef53edd083369f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「只要等待，夜路也会变明亮」～！\r\n我会带着这样的心情大步迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2626d182dd749cef7254db88b4f7f070bd8a8850c0ed7dda7cc8a120a8ce71d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8635980b59181f3b21f04d87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直道舞会的季节……\r\n大家怀揣着各自的心情，\r\n走在樱花树道下……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d32593612f9bb4404d83a6839e5212543a84e00760501d6dbe7302c3278aac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07a8ec6b24fd88476407235b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白色的连衣裙\r\n很适合夏天呢。就像\r\n「白鱼入白浪」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8fd1862c53285159a0620e7264a16c5cc2b87dcd2880c29367b4be2706894a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95b06a0a83f2e667ed140f39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您知道吗？\r\n即使到了秋天，\r\n也依然会有樱花绽放哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2049ebbcd0a3be82f61323f903d2ac20a7755f476bbecbbc383091f1943d66a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7b1c1e3c6c41ca35b25da5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇哇哇，说我像雪之妖精\r\n实在是太夸奖我了啦～\r\n才没有我这么冒失的妖精呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e890091017d54eea0606609434ed65ab3834648b98ea4429308c5af2182c4495",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22a536dca6709366b978dc7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这副耳环跟\r\n阿尔丹同学是成对的哦♪\r\n也得想办法给八重无敌同学送一副……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba5e91bb7fad8813256f63ded2064aae1586396846e5905fa304ca57a33deb4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f09a090f81869eb192df74a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "两条叠戴在一起的项链，\r\n就像泥地赛道与\r\n草地赛道的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd70d456fac9cb7ae27187ae888f94a15f07df703e5478a7b1654b9ce563d49d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:554e8982453d70034c4bd7b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的准备已经做好了，\n今天也要不断努力、不断积累！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2181c9a2f68d45aa5cfba79758331819cb1fea57349000921156563f7089cee0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b5268a5b365fa60f6b0fbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37856990395c2e8d2f93741c5d35fcb43678531f679cbab98ac4667a82bdf516",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:862ea5eaad5eb518ae1db46f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『不发芽的话就吃不了樱饼』！\n得一步步地踏实前进才行呢。\n今天也拜托您了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ebab57075774fcb8f5889f62b0be7fd2569684929360c97a9efbfeea12f6334",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b13f73ffbea27236db448639",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体感觉好轻盈……！\n请告诉我训练内容吧，不用多虑啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "975a61aa56af078686ff094a802d64a153f475be3c48cde2a0ebd17bdb28520c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8da7e94afb3cf99b3f4795fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天准备先做什么训练呢？\n不管是什么训练我都会好好完成的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eec53e415195573217549e758a9c36cc7657904260cf7a32bf41632443cb3429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a392be1555a3bdeb40c52b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然训练员都这么努力了，\n我也得加把劲才行！\n那遥远的梦想，就让我们一起实现吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d430183e7c9cf8b022607c175e54f3ab42cb5510ea998ed67dd0e9be18b69cfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a50ef30088821f06666bc3a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿嘿！训练员的指导，\n我已经全～部好好记在千代笔记上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e6a2db719478d6d1c6b57bb0661aed1028bad025ea292fa65cf0f95859dfcde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dae804b427392d8a846dbc55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请您好好注视着我哦！\n在训练员身边的话，\n我一定能绽放地比所有人都绚丽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e642d0c3392bee4d1669a566d7bd3b201bfa85984d77b5ba2b9031b58d04246",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108c4aae874d9d3f9b5c41cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天游客很多，所以稍微有些紧张…\n――不对！不该这样！必须每日精进\n才行！打起精神来，千代王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b22df2f3453472ef42f19c55accde8d97780b4aded182d24f408e001f2c76b37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5db926a5a780adfb80f94b48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧！\r\n如翩翩起舞般～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d93d61bc81cb6ed8b1b25bea86d41eb870ef6a58ee1ead46e22b5549cd4cfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:802acb480c9df5a6f4c08c01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「就算期盼花期也可能会落空」。\r\n既然如此，\r\n就只能靠自己的实力了，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9ae45fbfd6765e9f7b8450404aecf256db87b0eb3e37c248c5c696149ff7c81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec855258139fcf50336a859b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也要华丽地划下句号！\r\n唔，我能做到吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "baebbf44853526bdce4acd79a21a74bc9c8588054fd6fefc28bdb80196c357b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e374b790877200660716d36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信日复一日的努力，\r\n终将迎来美好的转折点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "224f3994935aa314f3e80a0aad9641b6fceee676f01334074b014df9ce0b7320",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:889a3992f9e7eeda6cf5ba0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望能让训练员的笑容\r\n如花朵般绽放♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb70e61b2eb9841ff6d97c04d3b7487e4aa8fa34f621212f8b648fb60b661359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6315f5a2d3e4e1dc0a68d00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「即使是终将凋零的花，\r\n在凋零之前也依然美丽」。\r\n我们两人的花，绝对不会褪色的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "516d809ae9ac6c4fe6b58ce4c4b5da48adfdc6cdae789d57b1551bfaeb3a1424",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c795c8b4c42b8355a3b05a8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任何重要的典礼，\r\n都希望有训练员陪在我身边……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "428044519d7297fa27e7dfe8a24eb2066fc277fb755c4879c8d6ea3707c36e7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28eac3ed66ab2c20f0042f65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今往后……\n我也会继续在您身边盛情绽放哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aff05293b0a2dd4f552093453f2efac0aea4e8ba7effaded748736072a4bf25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c43e308a077ebb9c279f00b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……终于盛开了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2151575f204eded46b80ebdeb5c014ce4b92e83a7f6d95fcbea528b1f20ed0ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:744b0082c20288362002598a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望你能永远记住\r\n我今天的身影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "157d3e011c4fab3811a0f7b3c2e92656f1f449e0862d45870d64d02d132f8999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf5d7d0e4338893047764c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是否成为全新的樱花了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1339b982472bb77efbbe18b8de73145c1a50547a9b597f2a4c4dda66d90185ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d89fa96377716cafaa1c7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还需要不断精进呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a1ff39691e7c93366f8a7fe5b2ed3da9648519d42a79da96d8777a521760e5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3316c80693208da8c66666f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会绽放得更加绚丽的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c029f4a457b52b03e7a50f2b8e8b3071f0febbe9aff64d785e8689d53b17bf79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9de5af2b2eb73e934fa2323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王，会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ddf1a91094edfdebbea32b60b70b4f1580c90726ccf9e2a40569a41b88cb039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2291bc3e46d008d6ec059d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『樱花会因努力而满开』！\n为了实现梦想，我出赛了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2d99db4ef8e3ce731c31cb85e4ce28a0c4e1818c506815e0c3e76d1e02202e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04d151e8cc78a1fb7db415ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有变得比以前更厉害吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b0f1d677dad838d0f7036e95c22847068d0b0f749641a1490f6dc3d2cabab7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b1e4cd2f1ab7a4f0c56c2bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢噢！又一朵花绽放了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe5ecf7ded5fff3ab721b4bb54c8f34764c2d667b7049904303746bfdc3100ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a06127d0cd08524b214fb824",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又绽放一朵樱花了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1768b51b885acb9a73e6fdf1c91731308a827683941501ef58b50c9888071b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d6e586727d80a06ac3e634f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝着蓝天努力长大～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b877d00c21426df068bbf63d05a67b643b0260280bc004cf7b2acb79421d4d64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47496deffd58c522b5a0529c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为与邂逅季节相称的\r\n最棒的樱花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd1e4912ce67ccc151cf3b9aede099c7d29e75fcb3b082aa90b488fb957de99e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60fd6122f14d0f61f697be09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是稍微盛装打扮的\r\n樱花千代王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8409eba04ad47a22dc0bdd6855d843705c1fc6205729df5d028ebae072cfb22c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e5dc5dcffff6733d42c5517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绷紧神经！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fafe14c523948a653a1bc374df5d06fcaf3c54ed793f1b61b4c898bb6fc12292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5eed6aa3d5ed9164e3c2718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的道路全由自己决定。将牢笼和\r\n锁链全数破坏，在目标的「世界」\r\n里大放异彩的──将会是我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a5833874881fc45bee1107bda0c1ac8749bd5fb51d85d96963f41b0d69d635c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a41acb72750d0381f596975",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00ffdd690510d1bac4516f25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻ったぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb603bcbaf54388661ce8ddfcaa8d5fc2aa49d8bacf52392c7a69c44dc9517b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a1b37e6b0ba0a70f76979f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小狗的牙齿越尖锐，我越喜欢。\r\n因为这样才有调教的价值。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9be9a5ccead928661dd087d081d3e4a7afc34c0f7479636fc966863bb115e18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f20a56894639992161824ef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，那边那只眼神焦虑的小狗，\r\n你能够立即说出\r\n最闪耀一等星的名字吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cd14568cf2133cc4cda55b1ab3e000dd4fa3b0ae58e44ed0fed9b8592f568fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac5fc96e802b663e031ad4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年吗……真是麻烦的时节，那些\r\n料理让人感到沉重。更何况那家伙的\r\n脸在学园里已经看够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5543ca557051f7388dbc44be38e8c978acace9c1996b05aa71f324d6ab19bcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90e90518435afd0fc16f901f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，暂时借你的训练员室一用。\r\n我想找个地方存放\r\n这些甜到腻的供品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de0d595b85f17254fe8213866a59cab9faf208c37a5b1299a537c34e04e63941",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266f02aa388b97c381710cfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可别忘了要向主人摇尾巴啊。\r\n该献给我的话呢？\r\n──你应该明白吧，小狗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91296ba6e1d17c856ff7cb178215b8ea219d281ff4ed083885e2d56d7528b0e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da08aac734777d48890fae0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一年一度梦寐以求的相遇啊……\r\n若能好好遵守我的指示，扮演好\r\n洋娃娃的角色我就不担心了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de8468276b62501ea700c8ff9465337489d98b5e6a761d8346dd32c3d10f2123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb1a7f0d89e6392c522b8898",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节的回忆吗？\r\n我只记得连我的朋友都和我一起穿上\r\n狼人装了吧？但都是小时候的事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a04b5cc0bce0d47748dba21a201f938553b91e8dd27e026e2941afb771458541",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b65d8294528fe6b09d6b8ce1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啧……我要出去。\r\n学生会主办的什么派对，\r\n让整间食堂吵得要命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9de074b9ede13b339c86012daa3e3b77021758512594d3cd9289c41536bfc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ffebd84e0137d15521013b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "才想说怎么冷成这样，\r\n原来是预报说会下雪啊。\r\n──快准备好，小狗。带你去散步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3069ab513a7b366e4010e0b6f112d51f904bc5fd90b557f9c396b888f4daebc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf004d92ab077dc98068c23d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你们做得很好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0415045b1428fd4edc52342a94cdc8c6aa8cc372a0bc8dbdd3b0459eefa392de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24a11ec3a4cc7e5d5a7426c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论新的一年是否到来，\r\n要做的事也不会有所改变。\r\n我只要开拓我自己的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa660723bce20619fa3aa939cec8f5a4310fb28dcea80520d04eb1cb5dfc7bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8444b7d5df498c3377465112",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，生日啊。转三圈再叫一声\r\n来听听，这样我至少可以帮你\r\n唱首生日快乐歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86a55a24571c83882ba476d02926ebb717908fdd3b7ca205a189a4032e8ee39f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eca7f8fa64e14b64f4d13805",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……身为小狗的你到处奔波忙碌，\r\n算是表现得挺出色的嘛。\r\n奖励拿去吧，可别忘了摇尾巴啰？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c0fdb50f8708af49f4c69606c6f30666f5b0fc5a1061a037746e9027a90273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2df5ba9a2af1fcfcc3db4d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从以前开始，我的生日礼物\r\n都是高级训练用具……至少我还有\r\n自己是在呵护中长大的自觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df539986d77bcb2dd4b4e27a4ad06d3bc8f8e7d4f2df347b4b4654ab0960f3ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ed8661a609809ce0e6a335",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你问我想要什么生日礼物啊……好像\r\n差不多得换个新的小狗项圈了呢？\r\n──哈哈！别当真了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6b6f2fe41684f18277711b6f0c91afcb1e9cde3b9806bd0b100496470bd5a59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10014"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
